  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FVrzKQ4/falling-leaves.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/463155.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_463155_downloads.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffallingleavesforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enchantmentmachine?color=00AF5C&label=modrinth&style=flat&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252flgpl-3.0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-LGPL v3-blue.svg\" alt=\"License: LGPL v3\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.paube.de%252freleases%252fde%252fcheaterpaul%252ffallingleaves%252fFallingleaves\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badgen.net/maven/v/metadata-url/https/maven.paube.de/releases/de/cheaterpaul/fallingleaves/Fallingleaves/maven-metadata.xml\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>此适用于 Minecraft 1.16+ 的 Forge 模组为树叶方块添加了精致的粒子效果。用户可以配置哪些类型的树叶方块会掉落树叶，以及掉落频率。本模组仅限客户端使用。</p>\n<p>这是从 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Falling Leaves (Fabric)</a> 移植而来（将配置界面替换为数据包，更多信息请见下文）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qRYkDjk/Y6zGq33.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>配置：</h2>\n<p>您可以在配置目录下的 <code>fallingleaves-client.toml</code> 文件中配置以下设置：</p>\n<p><code>leafSize</code>：修改树叶的大小</p>\n<p><code>leafLifespan</code>：修改树叶消失所需的时间</p>\n<p><code>leafSpawnRate</code>：修改生成树叶的数量</p>\n<p><code>coniferLeafSpawnRate</code>：修改针叶树生成树叶的数量</p>\n<p><code>dropFromPlayerPlacedBlocks</code>：玩家放置的方块是否也应掉落树叶</p>\n<p><code>minimumFreeSpaceBelow</code>：树叶方块下方需要保留多少空间才能生成树叶</p>\n<p><code>disableWind</code>：禁用树叶粒子的风力效果</p>\n<p><code>windlessDimension</code>：所有不应有风力的维度类型列表</p>\n<h4>1.3.0</h4>\n<p><code>seasonFallRate</code>：Serene Seasons（宁静四季）模组中落叶速率的修改器列表</p>\n<h2>数据包：</h2>\n<h3>1.3.0 版本之前</h3>\n<p>除了预定义的值之外，您还可以通过嵌入自定义值将特定树叶定义为针叶树。您需要按照与 <code>data/modid/fallingleaves/blockname.json</code> 中内置值相同的模式创建数据包，并使用以下语法和默认值：</p>\n<pre><code>{\n  &quot;spawnrate&quot;: 1.0,\n  &quot;isConifer&quot;: false\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h3>2.0.0 及更高版本</h3>\n<p>请在此处查看所有功能：<a href=\"https://github.com/Cheaterpaul/fallingleaves/wiki#for-2xx\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Cheaterpaul/fallingleaves/wiki#for-2xx</a></p>",
